<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 21.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 21.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.53    5.15</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	10.64    2.35</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 9.42    1.04</p>
<p> 4   BT Prop Trust	   9.22    1.77</p>
<p> 5   Villa World	     9.17    1.20</p>
<p> 6   Indu Property	   8.96    0.96</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 8.92    1.13</p>
<p> 8   Aust Tour		 8.82    0.85</p>
<p> 9   Centro Prop	     8.67    2.25</p>
<p>10   Hills Inds		8.55    2.00</p>
<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	8.49    0.92</p>
<p>12   Natl In Prop	    8.20    1.07</p>
<p>13   Colonial Mutual	 8.16    1.26</p>
<p>14   Countrywide-PP	  8.13    1.25</p>
<p>15   Equitilink		8.06    0.62</p>
<p>16   Colonial Coml	   8.02    2.30</p>
